Error [E0121]: `a` was consumed by the move `^a`, so it can't be used here
  --> move_mark_positions.jet:22:11
    |
 22 |     print(a.len())
    |           ^
  --> move_mark_positions.jet:14:23
    |
 14 |     holder :: Box{xs: ^a}
    |                       ^^ `a` moved to the move `^a` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `a` after the move, or give the move `^a` a copy with `~a` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121

